+  // A cut: the history is dropped. Seen in the cameras themselves (cut-scenes cut between nearby shots of the
+  // same players, where the picture's centre may move little): the ray through the screen's centre turned more
+  // than 10 degrees in a frame, or its point just past the near plane jumped more than 4 times the ray's length
+  // from there to mid depth (the walk-out's cuts: 20 to 600 times; its tracking shots move it up to 0.7 a frame
+  // along an unchanged ray); or the centre at mid depth moved more than a third of the width.
   TaaCamera& camera = taa_camera_;
   camera.reset = !taa_last_done_ || !taa_profile_have_prev_;
+  if (taa_profile_have_prev_) {
+    Mat4 previous_inverse;
